Z||000001||Raydar||12-29-1999||10:45 PM||||The TCC solenoid is controlled by the computer (among other things). I would question whether the prom is really doing what it is supposed to. I also have an 88 2.5 automatic. Been a while since I drove it, but it always seemed like the converter locked at too slow a speed. (Thought that it was by design, to improve gas mileage.)  Seems to lug the engine. Not sure if it actually shuddered or not. ||||reg||1
